    "# 🚀 OpenAI Fine-Tuning\n",
    "\n",
    "**Fine-tune GPT models on your custom data**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 📋 Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "**What you'll learn:**\n",
    "- OpenAI fine-tuning workflow\n",
    "- Uploading training data\n",
    "- Monitoring training jobs\n",
    "- Using fine-tuned models\n",
    "- Cost optimization\n",
    "\n",
    "**Time estimate:** ⏱️ 60 minutes | **Difficulty:** 🟡 Intermediate\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from openai import OpenAI\n",
    "import os\n",
    "import time\n",
    "import json\n",
    "from typing import Dict, List\n",
    "\n",
    "client = OpenAI(api_key=os.getenv('OPENAI_API_KEY'))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ Setup complete\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🤔 Why OpenAI Fine-Tuning?\n",
    "\n",
    "### When to Fine-Tune:\n",
    "\n",
    "✅ **Good use cases:**\n",
    "- Consistent output format/style\n",
    "- Domain-specific language\n",
    "- Replacing long prompts\n",
    "- Improving reliability\n",
    "- Reducing latency\n",
    "\n",
    "❌ **Not ideal for:**\n",
    "- Teaching new facts (use RAG)\n",
    "- Frequently changing knowledge\n",
    "- Small improvements (try prompting first)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Available Models:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Model | Cost (per 1K tokens) | Training Time | Use Case |\n",
    "|-------|---------------------|---------------|----------|\n",
    "| **gpt-3.5-turbo** | $0.008 | ~10 min | Fast, cheap |\n",
    "| **gpt-4o-mini** | $0.002 | ~15 min | Best value |\n",
    "| **babbage-002** | $0.0004 | ~5 min | Very cheap |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Benefits:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "Before Fine-Tuning:\n",
    "  Prompt: 500 tokens (instructions + examples)\n",
    "  Cost: High per request\n",
    "\n",
    "After Fine-Tuning:\n",
    "  Prompt: 50 tokens (just the query)\n",
    "  Cost: 90% reduction\n",
    "  Latency: 50% faster\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
